#: ../../functions/func_div.rst:6
msgid "$div"
msgstr ""

#: ../../functions/func_div.rst:8
msgid "Usage: **$div(x,y,\\*args)**"
msgstr "用法：**$div(x,y,\\*args)**"

#: ../../functions/func_div.rst:9
msgid "Category: mathematical"
msgstr "类别：数学"

#: ../../functions/func_div.rst:11
msgid "**Description:**"
msgstr "**描述：**"

#: ../../functions/func_div.rst:13
msgid "Divides x by y and returns the integer value (rounded down). Can be used with an arbitrary number of arguments (i.e.: ``$div(x,y,z)`` = (x / y) / z). If an argument is empty or not an integer, the function will return an empty string. If the second or any subsequent argument is zero, the function will return an empty string."
msgstr ""
"将 x 除以 y 并返回整数值（向下舍入）。可以与任意数量的参数一起使用（即"
"：``$div(x,y,z)`` = (x / y) / z）。如果参数为空或不是整数，函数将返回空字符串"
"。如果第二个或任何后续参数为零，函数将返回空字符串。"

#: ../../functions/func_div.rst:16
msgid "**Example:**"
msgstr "**示例：**"

#: ../../functions/func_div.rst:18
msgid "The following statements will return the values indicated:"
msgstr "以下语句将返回指示的值："
